":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YU6mM","user":{"login":"eobet","id":3254196,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTQxOTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3254196?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet","html_url":"https://github.com/eobet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-08T22:53:57Z","updated_at":"2025-12-08T22:53:57Z","body":"Hmm... I tried downloading the artifacts from that link, but the minimal Linux build says a .pck file is missing and the mono build naturally complains about my lack of Mono since I don't normally use that version of Godot.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3629361548/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3641010145","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113710#issuecomment-3641010145","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113710","id":3641010145,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ZBWfh","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-11T09:22:16Z","updated_at":"2025-12-11T09:22:16Z","body":"Sorry, I don't use the artifacts that much, so I'm not sure how to help 😅\n\n> the minimal Linux build says a .pck file is missing\n\nThe minimal build is just a template with basically everything disabled, it doesn't have the editor, so that's to be expected.\n\n> the mono build naturally complains about my lack of Mono since I don't normally use that version of Godot.\n\nLast time I tried, you could just skip the mono warning, but if I recall correctly this was never really supported. Maybe this got worse. Again, no idea.\n\nIf it fails at the popup, arguably the simplest solution would be to install .NET, as per the [C# basics](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.html) page of the docs.\n\nDepending on how technically inclined you are, you might as well try to build the editor. I'm kinda biased (xD) but it's really simple, compared to other software. You can also consult the fine [Building from source](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/engine_details/development/compiling/index.html) section of the engine development manual, and obviously ask me for help, I'd be glad to help.\n\nOne last option would be to make me do the testing, since I assume that this is either the same problem as the related issue, or a gnome-specific thing. This might take a bit of time, as I'm currently split between lots of things and I'm aware of various shortcomings (both from the engine and the backend) in the window resizing logic. Please be patient.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3641010145/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3747575459","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113710#issuecomment-3747575459","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113710","id":3747575459,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7fX3aj","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-14T03:54:00Z","updated_at":"2026-01-14T03:54:00Z","body":"Hi, can you still replicate this issue in th