-9830-a8a852d988fe\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3751817176/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3751885715","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113710#issuecomment-3751885715","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113710","id":3751885715,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7foTuT","user":{"login":"JamesMowery","id":868178,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2ODE3OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/868178?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMowery","html_url":"https://github.com/JamesMowery","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMowery/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMowery/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMowery/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMowery/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMowery/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMowery/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMowery/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMowery/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMowery/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-14T21:53:12Z","updated_at":"2026-01-14T21:55:36Z","body":"Below is a screen recording of what I'm seeing on just released 4.6-rc1 on CachyOS + Hyprland. The first half is with the main Godot window is in psuedo full-screen mode (aka \"monocle\"; the dialogs still open in floating mode). The second half is when is when the main Godot window is in floating mode (the dialogs still open in floating mode).\n\nhttps://s.mowery.io/-WohQXLvnuF/screenrecording-2026-01-14_14-38-18.mp4\n(alternative link in case above is too slow, which it is for me at the moment: https://limewire.com/d/o211H#Upn8So6ymt)\n\nWhen the main game window is in floating window mode, it does appear to remember the previous size after initially opening to max height, but in the psuedo full screen mode it goes full max height no matter what.\n\n(I also tested in true full screen mode on Hyprland, and it does function correctly with dialogs remembering prior sizing.)\n\nIn all situations, after restarting Godot, all the dialogs initially go back to max vertical height.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3751885715/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3751992577","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113710#issuecomment-3751992577","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113710","id":3751992577,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7fot0B","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api